From aff0a71709132fd292c49860b0b9de372b7310aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 23:19:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Fix SQRT encoding, SNaN and default NaN for
 SQRT/RECIP/RSQRT

FUNCT_SQRT is 4 (8 is ROUND.L). A signaling NaN operand and the invalid operations (sqrt(-1)) now give the positive default quiet NaN, like the other FPU instructions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018SdekJdqLaBJww2BpHWL2P
